\f1\fs22 His mates were already there. Not at their regular table, but another on the other side of the club. Still near enough the dance floor for gawking, but far enough away for conversation. Halo was already scanning the dancers like a sniper.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'93Found her yet?\'94 Chanta asked.\
